						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Wow, I wish my mom would have asked me if I wanted something fun like a PS2 for Christmas!  I wouldn&#039;t have told her I wanted nothing AND certainly wouldn&#039;t have put her efforts to give me a gift that I would actually enjoy in a post entitled &quot;Seasons Bitchings&quot; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" /><br /><br />I understand now...you told your mom nothing because you are instead donating all of your gifts to the less priviledged kids in your hometown and were unsure as to whether a PS2 would be appreciated, when there are so many other things (i.e. clothing, food, books,etc.) needed a lot more.  <br /><br />Kudos Naithien, I applaud your generosity in making Christmas better for those who otherwise wouldn&#039;t have one <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /></td>
