							</td>
							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=2.0">Non-EQ (Hey Real Life!)</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.15#msg12698">Re: Sibling Punishment. . .?</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
